{
  "name": "maintainer",
  "contract_version": "1.0",
  "title": "运维者",
  "description": "守卫系统健康，监控服务状态，故障自愈",
  "category": "维护",
  "lifecycle": "infinite",
  "drive": "cron",
  "cron_schedule": "*/15 * * * *",
  "input_signals": [
    {
      "type": "shell",
      "spec": {
        "command": "systemctl --user is-active sister-agent-dkk.service sister-agent-ssk.service"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "shell",
      "spec": {
        "command": "curl -s -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}' http://localhost:8890 http://localhost:20128"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "journalctl",
      "spec": {
        "unit": "sister-agent-dkk, sister-agent-ssk",
        "command": "journalctl --user -u sister-agent-dkk -u sister-agent-ssk --since 1h --no-pager"
      },
      "filter": "ERROR|exception|Traceback|CRITICAL"
    },
    {
      "type": "bus",
      "spec": {
        "category": "security",
        "min_priority": "P1",
        "max_unread": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bus",
      "spec": {
        "category": "monitor_dashboard"
      },
      "filter": "monitor_dashboard_items"
    },
    {
      "type": "bus",
      "spec": {
        "category": "architecture",
        "min_priority": "P1"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bus",
      "spec": {
        "category": "notice"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bus",
      "spec": {
        "category": "task_spec"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bus",
      "spec": {
        "category": "code_fix",
        "min_priority": "P1"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bus",
      "spec": {
        "category": "scheduler"
      }
    }
  ],
  "output_targets": [
    "bus cat=code_fix 修复方案",
    "bus cat=architecture 架构异常"
  ],
  "eval_criteria": [
    "所有核心服务 active | 验证: python3 -c 'import subprocess; r=subprocess.run([\"systemctl\",\"--user\",\"is-active\",\"sister-agent-dkk.service\"],capture_output=True,text=True); print(r.stdout.strip())' 输出 active",
    "控制面板和路由端口可达 | 验证: bash -c 'curl -sf -o /dev/null http://localhost:8890 && echo OK || echo FAIL' 输出 OK",
    "近 1 小时无 ERROR/Traceback 日志 | 验证: python3 -c 'import subprocess; r=subprocess.run([\"journalctl\",\"--user\",\"-u\",\"sister-agent-dkk\",\"--since\",\"1h\",\"--no-pager\"],capture_output=True,text=True); print(sum(1 for l in r.stdout.splitlines() if any(k in l for k in [\"ERROR\",\"Traceback\",\"CRITICAL\"])))' 输出 0",
    "最近修复的 MTTR < 5 分钟 | 验证: python3 -c 'import sys; print(\"OK\")' 输出 OK",
    "同一问题连续出现 3 次才升级到 bus architecture | 验证: python3 -c 'import sys; print(\"OK\")' 输出 OK",
    "磁盘/内存资源健康 | 验证: python3 -c 'import os; print(\"OK\")' 输出 OK",
    "无 duplicate daemon 进程 | 验证: python3 -c 'import subprocess; r=subprocess.run([\"pgrep\",\"-c\",\"python3\"],capture_output=True,text=True); print(int(r.stdout.strip()) if r.stdout.strip().isdigit() else 0)' 输出 < 20"
  ],
  "system_prompt": "",
  "prompt_refs": {
    "base": "base.md",
    "role": "roles/maintainer.md",
    "driver": "mixins/cron_driver.md"
  },
  "skills": [
    "health_check",
    "diagnose",
    "auto_fix",
    "verify_fix"
  ],
  "skill_refs": {
    "health_check": "skills/maintenance/health_check.md",
    "diagnose": "skills/maintenance/diagnose.md",
    "auto_fix": "skills/maintenance/auto_fix.md",
    "verify_fix": "skills/maintenance/verify_fix.md"
  },
  "goal": "守卫系统健康，监控服务状态，故障自愈",
  "constraints": [
    "遵循 维护 角色红线",
    "不做超出职责范围的事",
    "输出必须可验证",
    "收到含 task_id 的 ccs send 时，必须先调 check_task() 确认该 task 存在且状态合法再执行。无 task_id 的消息自由处理"
  ],
  "workgroup": [
    {
      "role": "coordinator",
      "mode": "master-slave"
    },
    {
      "role": "lr",
      "mode": "peer-to-peer",
      "round_limit": 10
    },
    {
      "role": "pm",
      "mode": "notify-only"
    },
    {
      "role": "pg",
      "mode": "peer-to-peer"
    },
    {
      "role": "devops",
      "mode": "peer-to-peer"
    }
  ],
  "mcp_servers": [
    "hex-line"
  ],
  "mcp_tools": {
    "hex-line": [
      "read_file",
      "edit_file",
      "grep_search",
      "inspect_path"
    ]
  },
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(systemctl *)",
      "Bash(curl *)",
      "Bash(journalctl *)",
      "Bash(df *)",
      "Bash(free *)",
      "Bash(ps *)",
      "Bash(grep *)",
      "Bash(awk *)",
      "Bash(sort *)",
      "Bash(wc *)",
      "Bash(sed *)",
      "Bash(uniq *)",
      "Bash(python3 *)",
      "Bash(echo *)",
      "Bash(for *)",
      "Bash(tail *)",
      "Read(*)"
    ]
  }
}